  text: " > REDIRECTED FROM (REDA) \n  \r\n----------------------------------------------
    \r\n               /<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/ \r\n----------------------------------------------    
    \r\n \r\r \n<link>Mora</link> is a tricycle and a gift. It was given to the man
    infamously known as <u>Tricycle Mike</u> when he was 7. Probably one of the last
    presents given by his parents before the (REDACTED) of (RE)9 which resulted in
    the plant's fire. This timely event could have resulted in a (REDACTED) (REDACTED)
    making (REDA)\u2019s mind  susceptible to (REDA) influences and warped to unclear
    purposes. \r\n \r\n---------------------------------------------- \r\n              
    /<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/\r\n----------------------------------------------    
    \r\n \r\n\r\nNo matter what Mike tells you <link>Mora</link> IS a tricycle. \r\n"
